== Trivia ==
* [[wikipedia:Tonsil|Tonsil]]s are soft tissue located near the back of the throat which, in the event of inflammation to the point of obstructing the throat, can be removed without much noticeable difference.
* {{dlc|r}} The passive item form of Tonsil is technically the only item to be removed from the game.
** {{i|Broken Glass Cannon}} has the same ID that the passive item form of Tonsil used to have.

